{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03404","headline":"塞垣行 · 崔湜","name":"塞垣行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疾风卷溟海，万里扬砂砾。\n仰望不见天，昏昏竟朝夕。\n是时军两进，东拒复西敌。\n蔽山张旗鼓，间道潜锋镝。\n精骑突晓围，奇兵袭暗壁。\n十月边塞寒，四山沍阴积。\n雨雪鴈南飞，风尘景西迫。\n昔我事讨论，未尝怠经籍。\n一朝弃笔砚，十年操矛戟。\n岂要黄河誓，须勒燕然石。\n可嗟牧羊臣，海上久爲客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}